# The instance the dev build connects to, until the Connect screen exists: the address you open OpenBot at in your
# browser, as your phone reaches it (not localhost), e.g. http://192.168.1.20:3000 or http://box.tail1234.ts.net:3000.
# Copy to .env.local, which Expo reads at `pnpm dev`; restart Metro after changing it.
EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENBOT_URL=
